CORE dfcc-only
main.c
--dfcc main --enforce-contract callee
^\[callee\.assertion\.1\] line 22 variadic argument received: SUCCESS$
^\[my_log\.assigns\.\d+\] line 11 Check that g is assignable: SUCCESS$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
--
The write set parameter of an instrumented variadic function precedes the
declared parameters, so that va_start, which takes the arguments after the last
declared parameter, still sees exactly the variadic arguments.
